; brief-sar-8b R-sar8b-5 — MRI_LP_Birdcage's quadrature feed as a superposition: Birdcage.c3d's two 50 Ohm feeds as one
; two-port EM Field Data block, each driven from its own matched 50 Ohm circuit port, rung 1 at 1 and rung 3 at -j (the
; tutorial's quarter-period delay at 128 MHz). The fields analysis recombines the run's per-port fields — each port run alone,
; the other terminated in its 50 Ohm — with the incident waves this circuit delivers, before SAR and B1 are formed.
Wq = polar(1,-90)
Port:P1 f1 0 Num=1 Z=50 Ohm
Port:P2 f2 0 Num=2 Z=50 Ohm
EmFieldData:EM1 f1 f2 File="../results/Birdcage ReferenceGrid.openems.cemr"
analysis F1 type=fields block=EM1 freq=128 freqUnit=MHz drive=1,2 weights=1,Wq
